Scripts have already been run and compiled into registry_landfills.csv file that can be found in the dataset folder in root.

If run the scripts will automatically generate the corresponding .csv files based on the .xlsx files which are public registers downloaded from data.gov.rs.

**Before** running ResultsForSanitaryUnsanitary, open the script and adjust the filename to match the specific file for which you want to generate the final .csv file.

Final .csv file: contains all calculated and required data.
.xlsx files: contain only basic information.

**Execution order**:

run TypeToCSV for all three .xlsx files
run ResultsForWild
run ResultsForSanitaryUnsanitary twice, changing the input filenames accordingly
run CombineAll
run Formatting
run AddingTiles
run DeletingExtensions

The compiled data will be located in the registry_landfills.csv
